                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "00fbf90a-aa6f-4311-a1ca-84a6d0c5e456",
                                "sense_id": "5b00c083-5ab9-346d-a712-149569fd3e9a",
                                "text": "He rose up in his place and rent his dress.\n\" Let them be ganched upon the hooks, \" he cried,\n\" Throughout to-day, but not till they have died.\nThen gather all the slaves, and flay these three\nAlive, before them, that the slaves may see\nWhat comes to dogs who try to get away.\nSo, ganch the three.\""
